:{"en":"Teres major","ru":"Большая круглая мышца"},"region":"back","function_description":{"en":"Helps the lats pull the arm down and in.","ru":"Помогает широчайшим опускать и приводить руку."}},{"catalog_version":"fitness-v2-915b27fc7429a034","id":"rhomboids","group_id":"back","name":{"en":"Rhomboids","ru":"Ромбовидные"},"region":"back","function_description":{"en":"Pull the shoulder blades together; key for posture and rows.","ru":"Сводят лопатки; важны для осанки и тяг."}},{"catalog_version":"fitness-v2-915b27fc7429a034","id":"traps-upper","group_id":"back","name":{"en":"Upper traps","ru":"Верх трапеции"},"region":"back","function_description":{"en":"Lift the shoulders toward the ears and steady the neck under load.","ru":"Поднимают плечи к ушам и стабилизируют шею под нагрузкой."}},{"catalog_version":"fitness-v2-915b27fc7429a034","id":"traps-mid","group_id":"back","name":{"en":"Middle traps","ru":"Середина трапеции"},"region":"back","function_description":{"en":"Pull the shoulder blades back; loaded by rows and face pulls.","ru":"Отводят лопатки назад; нагружаются в тягах и тяге к лицу."}},{"catalog_version":"fitness-v2-915b27fc7429a034","id":"traps-lower","group_id":"back","name":{"en":"Lower traps","ru":"Низ трапеции"},"region":"back","function_description":{"en":"Pull the shoulder blades down; keep the shoulder healthy overhead.","ru":"Опускают лопатки; берегут плечо при работе над головой."}}]'::jsonb) as x(catalog_version text, id text, group_id text, name jsonb, region text, function_description jsonb)
