ng down away from the body, two handles on a lever whose pivot sits level with the elbows, a weight stack","generic_variant":true},{"catalog_version":"fitness-v2-915b27fc7429a034","id":"machine-pullover","equipment_id":"selectorized","name":{"en":"Machine pullover","ru":"Пуловер в тренажёре"},"geometry":"a seated pin-loaded pullover machine: a seat with a back pad and a hip belt, a curved bar above the head joined to padded elbow plates on a lever that rotates around the shoulders, a weight stack","generic_variant":true},{"catalog_version":"fitness-v2-915b27fc7429a034","id":"machine-row","equipment_id":"selectorized","name":{"en":"Chest-supported machine row","ru":"Горизонтальная тяга в тренажёре с упором в грудь"},"geometry":"a seated pin-loaded row machine: a seat, an upright padded chest rest in front, two handles on lever arms reaching forward with horizontal and vertical grips, a weight stack","generic_variant":true},{"catalog_version":"fitness-v2-915b27fc7429a034","id":"machine-shoulder-press","equipment_id":"selectorized","name":{"en":"Shoulder press machine","ru":"Жим над головой в тренажёре"},"geometry":"a seated pin-loaded shoulder press: an upright back pad, an adjustable seat, two handles at shoulder height on lever arms that travel straight up, a weight stack behind","generic_variant":true},{"catalog_version":"fitness-v2-915b27fc7429a034","id":"machine-shrug","equipment_id":"plate-loaded","name":{"en":"Machine shrug","ru":"Шраги в тренажёре"},"geometry":"a plate-loaded standing shrug machine: a platform to stand on between two handles at hip height at the ends of a lever arm, weight plates on horns at the lever ends","generic_variant":true},{"catalog_version":"fitness-v2-915b27fc7429a034","id":"machine-triceps-extension","equipment_id":"selectorized","name":{"en":"Machine triceps extension","ru":"Разгибание рук в тренажёре на трицепс"},"geometry":"a seated pin-loaded triceps extension machine: a seat, an angled arm pad in front, two handles on a lever whose pivot sits level with the elbows, a weight stack","generic_variant":true}]'::jsonb) as x(catalog_version text, id text, equipment_id text, name jsonb, geometry text, generic_variant boolean)
