he lower thighs, a foot step block, weight plates on a horn at the lever''s end, a safety release handle","generic_variant":true},{"catalog_version":"fitness-v2-915b27fc7429a034","id":"seated-leg-curl","equipment_id":"selectorized","name":{"en":"Seated leg curl","ru":"Сгибание ног сидя в тренажёре"},"geometry":"a seated pin-loaded leg curl: a seat with a back pad, a thigh pad that clamps down over the thighs just above the knees, a padded roller on a lever behind the lower calves with the pivot level with the knees, a weight stack","generic_variant":true}]'::jsonb) as x(catalog_version text, id text, equipment_id text, name jsonb, geometry text, generic_variant boolean)
