 lever arms that are pushed downward, a weight stack behind","generic_variant":true},{"catalog_version":"fitness-v2-915b27fc7429a034","id":"v-squat","equipment_id":"plate-loaded","name":{"en":"V-squat machine","ru":"Приседания в рычажном тренажёре (V-squat)"},"geometry":"a plate-loaded V-squat: an angled foot platform, padded shoulder yokes on a long lever arm that pivots behind, weight plates on a horn on the lever","generic_variant":true},{"catalog_version":"fitness-v2-915b27fc7429a034","id":"vertical-traction","equipment_id":"selectorized","name":{"en":"Machine lat pulldown (lever)","ru":"Вертикальная тяга в рычажном тренажёре"},"geometry":"a seated pin-loaded vertical traction machine: a seat with padded knee rollers on a short post at the front end of the seat, resting on top of the thighs just behind the knees (in a profile view: a round pad seen end-on, sitting on top of the thigh near the knee, never behind the hips), two independent handle arms above the head that pull down in an arc (no bar and no cable at the hands), a weight stack","generic_variant":true}]'::jsonb) as x(catalog_version text, id text, equipment_id text, name jsonb, geometry text, generic_variant boolean)
