achine: a seat that turns with knee pads that hold the legs, an upright chest pad with handles, a starting-angle selector, a weight stack","setup":"seated with the knees between the pads, chest against the pad, arms on the handles","start":"hips turned to one side with the seat, torso facing forward","end":"hips and seat turned to the other side, torso still facing forward"}},{"catalog_version":"fitness-v2-915b27fc7429a034","exercise_id":"seated-cable-row","machine_id":"seated-cable-row","configuration":{"geometry":"a seated cable row (low row) station: a long low bench, an angled foot platform, a low pulley at foot level with a close-grip V-handle (two parallel grips), a weight stack at the far end","setup":"sitting on the bench, feet on the platform, knees softly bent, torso upright; both hands on the V-handle with the palms facing each other","start":"arms extended forward toward the pulley, shoulder blades spread, torso upright and leaning forward no more than slightly","end":"handle pulled to the belly just below the ribs, elbows driven back close to the sides, shoulder blades squeezed, torso upright and still"}},{"catalog_version":"fitness-v2-915b27fc7429a034","exercise_id":"seated-calf-raise-machine","machine_id":"seated-calf-raise-machine","configuration":{"geometry":"a plate-loaded seated calf raise: a seat, a padded knee lever resting on the lower thighs, a foot step block, weight plates on a horn at the lever''s end, a safety release handle","setup":"seated, knees under the pad, balls of the feet on the step","start":"heels dropped below the step","end":"heels raised as high as possible, lifting the knee pad"}},{"catalog_version":"fitness-v2-915b27fc7429a034","exercise_id":"seated-leg-curl","machine_id":"seated-leg-curl","configuration":{"geometry":"a seated pin-loaded leg curl: a seat with a back pad, a thigh pad that clamps down over the thighs just above the knees, a padded roller on a lever behind the lower calves with the pivot level with the knees, 