 front, back or three-quarter view","alignmentCamera":"close side view of the stated contact/joint","requiredViewCount":6,"requiredViews":["identity","adjustment","setup","start","end","alignment"],"checkpoints":[{"id":"frame-identity","views":["identity","setup","start","end"],"observe":"Full fixed chassis: a seated pin-loaded row machine: a seat, an upright padded chest rest in front, two handles on lever arms reaching forward with horizontal and vertical grips, a weight stack","reject":"Changed frame feet, extra stack/lever, floating component or cropped load mechanism.","evidence":"Record an observation and normalized bounding box marking the relevant component/contact."},{"id":"exercise-configuration","views":["adjustment","setup","start","end"],"observe":"Attachment and hardware: a seated pin-loaded row machine: a seat, an upright padded chest rest in front, two handles on lever arms reaching forward with horizontal and vertical grips, a weight stack","reject":"Wrong attachment, resistance mechanism, cable routing or rail/pad orientation.","evidence":"Record an observation and normalized bounding box marking the relevant component/contact."},{"id":"adjustments","views":["adjustment","setup"],"observe":"Before movement: seat set so the handles are level with the lower chest; chest rest set so the arms are fully stretched at the handles; chest against the pad, feet flat. The adjustment pin or latch is visibly engaged. Body-relative settings are not universal seat numbers or prescribed kilograms.","reject":"Unlatched adjustment, invented numbered setting/load, pad or grip contradicting the setup.","evidence":"Record an observation and normalized bounding box marking the relevant component/contact."},{"id":"setup-contacts","views":["setup","start","end"],"observe":"Supporting contacts and grip: seat set so the handles are level with the lower chest; chest rest set so the arms are fully stretched at the handles; chest against the pad, feet flat","reject":"Missing pad/foot/hand contact, fingers through the handle or required contact hidden from inspection.","evidence":"Record an observation and normalized bounding box marking the relevant component/contact."},{"id":"start-pose","views":["start"],"observe":"Working phase starts: arms extended forward holding the handles, shoulder blades spread forward, chest on the pad","reject":"Wrong start position, range, grip or support.","evidence":"Record an observation and normalized bounding box marking the relevant component/contact."},{"id":"end-pose","views":["end"],"observe":"Working phase ends: handles pulled back to the sides of the lower ribs, elbows driven back past the torso, shoulder blades squeezed together, chest still on the pad","reject":"Wrong endpoint, unintended lockout, torso compensation or shifted fixed hardware.","evidence":"Record an observation and normalized bounding box marking the relevant component/contact."},{"id":"mechanical-travel","views":["start","end"],"observe":"Motion: a straight arrow just below the forearms, its tail at the handles and its head pointing LEFT toward the lower ribs and the seat (toward the left edge of the picture, away from the weight stack): the hands travel back toward the body. Lever rotates about its actual pivot; sled/bar stays on rails; cable stays connected along the same route.","reject":"Free-floating handle, cable through body/frame, impossible lever translation or moving camera/chassis.","evidence":"Record an observation and normalized bounding box marking the relevant component/contact."},{"id":"critical-alignment","views":["alignment"],"observe":"the end of the pull: handles beside the lower ribs, elbows behind the torso and close to the sides, shoulder blades squeezed, chest on the pad, torso upright","reject":"Critical contact, joint or pivot obscured; roller in wrong location, incorrect alignment or pose.","evidence":"Record an observation and normalized bounding box marking the relevant component/contact."},{"id":"tec