e silhouette, frame feet, weld topology, pad dimensions, upholstery, pivot positions, rail angle, cable routing, adjustment controls and attachment family. Moving handles, lever arms, sled and cable endpoints move as one physically connected mechanism. Never move fixed pads or invent a second mechanism to accommodate a pose. Use a generic training station, not an unverified branded model.","cameraLock":"Body views use a 50mm-equivalent orthographic-like view without wide-angle distortion, camera level, same camera/scale/crop across setup, start and end; adult and full working mechanism visible with 8% outer margin. Changing camera is permitted only for the named adjustment/alignment detail views. Camera settings are prompt constraints, not OpenAI API parameters.","api":{"model":"gpt-image-2-2026-04-21","n":1,"size":"1536x1024","quality":"high","background":"opaque","output_format":"png","moderation":"auto"},"requiredViews":["identity","adjustment","setup","start","end","alignment"],"review":{"initialStatus":"unreviewed","requiredEvidence":["reviewer","reviewedAt","imageSha256","promptSha256","actualModel","requestId","allCheckpointDecisions","referenceAssetHashes"],"checkpointEvidence":"Each checkpoint needs an explicit pass/fail, an observation, and at least one normalized bounding box marking the relevant part. Inspect at original resolution and at the delivered thumbnail size. Any failed, missing or hidden required contact blocks approval.","nonDeterminism":"A model snapshot and exact prompts improve traceability; neither seeds nor deterministic image reproduction are promised. No seed or input_fidelity parameter is sent. Actual requests/responses, reference hashes and output hashes must be recorded."},"machineNames":{"single-cable-tower":{"en":"Adjustable cable tower","ru":"Регулируемая блочная стойка"},"dual-cable-crossover":{"en":"Dual cable crossover","ru":"Двойной кроссовер"},"smith-vertical-rack":{"en":"Vertical Smith rack","ru":"Вертикальная машина Смита"}